{"game":"Time Rifters","source":"custom","apworld":"timerifters.apworld","world_version":"1.0.13","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99},"doc_fr":"Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.\n\nUn réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Un système qui peut déplacer la progression plus tôt, pour essayer et empêcher le joueur de se coincer et s'ennuyer tôt.</p>\n<p>Un réglage plus bas signifie qu'il reste coincé. Un réglage plus élevé signifie moins se coincer.</p>\n"},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full","doc_fr":"Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.\n\n**Full:** s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.\n\n**Minimal:** s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Définir les règles d'accessibilité de vos objets/emplacements.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> s'assurer que tout peut être atteint et acquis.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> s'assurer que ce qui est nécessaire pour atteindre votre objectif peut être acquis.</p>\n"},{"key":"escape_checks","name":"Enable hidden escape checks","kind":"toggle","doc":"Include the 15 hidden arena escapes and the Title Screen hidden escape.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"episode_keys","name":"Require episode keys","kind":"toggle","doc":"Require Archipelago items before Episodes 2 and 3 can be started.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"true"},{"key":"arena_shuffle","name":"Shuffle arenas between episodes","kind":"toggle","doc":"Shuffle all 15 arenas between episode groups; Episode 1 always has five playable arenas.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"arena_percentage_checks","name":"Arena percentage checks","kind":"range","doc":"Checks per arena, evenly spaced through 100%. Higher values add checks and room for Time Echoes.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":4,"max":20,"default":5,"doc_fr":"Contrôles par arène, uniformément espacés à travers 100%. Des valeurs plus élevées ajoutent des vérifications et de la place pour Time Echoes."},{"key":"required_time_echoes","name":"Required Time Echoes","kind":"range","doc":"Shop credits guaranteed as progression. Raise checks if the selected number will not fit.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":25,"max":84,"default":50},{"key":"upgrade_mode","name":"Shop power-up item mode","kind":"choice","doc":"Off keeps every shop power-up normal. Categories uses six shared items; per weapon uses one item for each real weapon power-up.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"off","label":"Off","id":0},{"value":"power_up_categories","label":"Power Up Categories","id":1},{"value":"per_weapon_power_ups","label":"Per Weapon Power Ups","id":2}],"aliases":{"false":"off"},"default":"off"},{"key":"goal","name":"Goal","kind":"choice","doc":"Completion target, based on best destruction percent rather than checks.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"75_percent","label":"75 Percent","id":75},{"value":"95_percent","label":"95 Percent","id":95},{"value":"99_percent","label":"99 Percent","id":99},{"value":"100_percent","label":"100 Percent","id":100},{"value":"final_boss_100_percent","label":"Final Boss 100 Percent","id":101}],"aliases":{},"default":"95_percent","doc_fr":"Objectif d'achèvement, basé sur le meilleur pourcentage de destruction plutôt que des vérifications."},{"key":"death_link","name":"Enable DeathLink","kind":"toggle","doc":"Send a DeathLink after finishing an arena below the selected percent; received links disable firing for one minute.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"},{"key":"death_link_percent","name":"DeathLink percent","kind":"range","doc":"Completed arenas below this destruction percent send a DeathLink.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":1,"max":100,"default":50,"doc_fr":"Les arènes terminées en dessous de cette destruction pour cent envoient un DeathLink."},{"key":"death_link_duration","name":"DeathLink firing-lock duration","kind":"range","doc":"Seconds that firing is disabled after receiving a DeathLink.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":30,"max":120,"default":60}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être dans leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Force ces objets à être en dehors de leur monde d'origine.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000,"doc_fr":"Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par le montant spécifié de ces éléments. Exemple : {Bomb : 1, Flèche : 3}</p>\n"},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true,"doc_fr":"Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande ``!hint``.","doc_html_fr":"<p>Commencez par les emplacements de ces éléments préremplis dans la commande <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt>.</p>\n"},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the <tt class=\"docut